            "physical_record_offset is computed ONCE, before the loop (binary 0x5f02f60-0x5f02f6a: end_of_buffer_offset_ - buffer_.size() at entry), so last_record_offset_ on a returning arm is the ENTRY-time offset, not the returned record's offset: when a SetCompressionType record precedes the returned record in the same call, last_record_offset_ points at the SetCompressionType record. Upstream log_reader.cc:1115 computes it the same way, once.",
